      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, margins",
          "value": "<p>the Commentary on \u02bf\u0112r\u016bv\u012bn by Rabb\u0113n\u016b Niss\u012bm for him. And most of the people in the town have asked me to serve as a schoolmaster in his house, for the town lacks everything. Were the town not unfit for you to live in (you could find a good job here) {read: I would suggest that you come}. However, the town is mediocre; one cannot live here. (...Here, it requires an) effort {read: Its homes are filthy and its people make little effort} to study and to pray. Since we arrived, there has been no public prayer </p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
